    "text": "Usually no, not for Kobbe on its own. The default tracker is cookieless: no analytics cookies, no persistent browser identifiers, and no analytics request when Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track is on. Many sites run Kobbe without a cookie banner for analytics. You may still need one if other tools on your site use cookies, if you enable optional Kobbe features such as cross-domain tracking, or if your jurisdiction requires consent for analytics. Check what applies to your site and audience."
